{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014H6s9d8x8jvde5Usfeeqs7","type":"tool_result","content":"172\t### 3. Event Log\n173\t\n174\tThe event log is append-only and replayable. It is the substrate that makes memory consolidation and usefulness measurement possible.\n175\t\n176\tRequired event types:\n177\t\n178\t- `AssistantTaskStarted`\n179\t- `ToolCalled`\n180\t- `ToolResult`\n181\t- `ContextBundleReturned`\n182\t- `MemoryRetrieved`\n183\t- `MemoryExpanded`\n184\t- `PlanCreated`\n185\t- `FileRead`\n186\t- `PatchApplied`\n187\t- `TestRunStarted`\n188\t- `TestRunCompleted`\n189\t- `DiagnosticObserved`\n190\t- `UserCorrection`\n191\t- `UserPreferenceObserved`\n192\t- `WorkflowSucceeded`\n193\t- `WorkflowFailed`\n194\t- `MemoryCreated`\n195\t- `MemoryUpdated`\n196\t- `MemoryInvalidated`\n197\t- `MemoryConsolidated`\n198\t\n199\tEvents should carry:\n200\t\n201\t- workspace id\n202\t- branch\n203\t- session id\n204\t- task id\n205\t- actor\n206\t- timestamp\n207\t- stable references to files, symbols, docs, events, and memories\n208\t- payload hash\n209\t- compact payload summary\n210\t- optional full payload location\n211\t\n212\tThe full event stream should not be injected into prompts. It exists for retrieval, audit, replay, metrics, and consolidation.\n213\t\n214\t### 4. Memory Graph\n215\t\n216\tMemory should be stored as typed claims and episodes, not loose notes."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1b2121c5-8450-4d0d-9f66-0986877cae23","uuid":"fe2e808d-2a1d-4d5a-8c96-cee3015f08db","timestamp":"2026-05-17T10:13:37.669Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/pete/cadres/lattice/docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-plan.md","content":"### 3. Event Log\n\nThe event log is append-only and replayable. It is the substrate that makes memory consolidation and usefulness measurement possible.\n\nRequired event types:\n\n- `AssistantTaskStarted`\n- `ToolCalled`\n- `ToolResult`\n- `ContextBundleReturned`\n- `MemoryRetrieved`\n- `MemoryExpanded`\n- `PlanCreated`\n- `FileRead`\n- `PatchApplied`\n- `TestRunStarted`\n- `TestRunCompleted`\n- `DiagnosticObserved`\n- `UserCorrection`\n- `UserPreferenceObserved`\n- `WorkflowSucceeded`\n- `WorkflowFailed`\n- `MemoryCreated`\n- `MemoryUpdated`\n- `MemoryInvalidated`\n- `MemoryConsolidated`\n\nEvents should carry:\n\n- workspace id\n- branch\n- session id\n- task id\n- actor\n- timestamp\n- stable references to files, symbols, docs, events, and memories\n- payload hash\n- compact payload summary\n- optional full payload location\n\nThe full event stream should not be injected into prompts. It exists for retrieval, audit, replay, metrics, and consolidation.\n\n### 4. Memory Graph\n\nMemory should be stored as typed claims and episodes, not loose notes.","numLines":45,"startLine":172,"totalLines":969}}}
